Package: rabidoctor
Type: Package
Title: Rabi Crop Disease Incidence, Severity Grading, and KVK Advisory Toolkit
Version: 1.0.1
Authors@R: person("Lunganlung", "P. G.",
    email = "227372907+lunganlungpg@users.noreply.github.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Base-R companion epidemiological toolkit for the Rabi Crop Doctor
    project. Computes plot-level Disease Incidence (%), converts foliar lesion
    percentages to standard 0-5 pathology ratings, calculates Wheeler (1969)
    Percent Disease Index (PDI), benchmarks agro-climatic Rabi risk across Indian
    states, and provides bilingual (English/Hindi) ICAR/KVK crop advisories.
