Encoding: UTF-8
URL: https://github.com/lunganlungpg/rabi-crop-doctor
BugReports: https://github.com/lunganlungpg/rabi-crop-doctor/issues
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: stats, utils
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
